Depends: adduser, systemd
Recommends: unbound, nginx
Homepage: https://github.com/Sakawat-hossain/PrivateDNS
Description: Multi-tenant filtering DNS platform
 PrivateDNS serves DNS-over-TLS, DNS-over-HTTPS and plain DNS, identifying
 each tenant from the TLS SNI and applying that tenant's own policy before
 answering.
 .
 Includes the resolver, an administration API, a customer portal and an
 operator dashboard. Storage is embedded SQLite; the binaries are static and
 have no runtime dependencies.
